From e9a0573ff190d191daa4c9498401b1e3371d6ed2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:35:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(desktop/kanban): blocked tasks get a left-pane section
 above Projects; no completion/blocked toasts [daveey]

- core: new `sidebar.sections` contribution area rendered between Pinned and
  Projects, with SidebarSection / SidebarSectionRow chrome exported via the SDK
- kanban: Blocked section lists every blocked card across boards and gateways
  (click opens its drawer); polled 30s + invalidated by live events
- completion-notify: per-kind quiet policy; the plugin silences 'completed'
  entirely and drops the in-app toast for 'blocked' (away-only OS
  notification kept). Failures/triage still toast.
